Package: anyfile-to-markdown
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         python3-pyqt6,
         python3-pip
Recommends: python3-pymupdf
Description: Universal file to Markdown converter — PDF, DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, images, HTML, EPUB and more
 Graphical interface for the MarkItDown library by Microsoft.
 Provides an easy way to convert various document formats to
 Markdown with a clean PyQt6 interface.
 .
 Supported formats: PDF, PowerPoint, Word, Excel, images,
 HTML, CSV, JSON, XML, EPUB, ZIP, audio, and more.
 .
 On first install, the package checks PyPI for the
 latest markitdown version and tests compatibility.
